 },
 "You can’t plan<br>real life.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "That’s the whole idea. At a random time, a notification arrives. Drop what you’re doing and, wherever you are, capture what’s around you right away, just as it is. Tap it and the camera opens. Busy? Skip it: no streaks to protect, no missed-day guilt.": {
