 "Questions": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Do I need to capture something every day?": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "No. A surprise is an invitation, not an assignment. Skip it and nothing is lost: there are no streaks and no reminders about what you missed.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Which iPhones does it work on?": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Any iPhone or iPad with iOS 18 or later.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Can I use only one camera?": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Yes, a single camera works too. On iPhones that can’t film with both cameras at once, MimoDays uses one.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Where are my memories stored?": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "On your iPhone, in MimoDays. Nothing goes to a MimoDays server. To keep a copy, make a backup in Settings › Backup and save it to Files, iCloud Drive or a computer.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Can I get my original photos and videos out?": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Yes. Export a moment as you see it in MimoDays, with the selfie window, or as the separate original camera files. You can also export many moments at once as one archive.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "Does it cost anything?": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
 "No. Every feature is free. If MimoDays helps you, you can leave an optional tip; it doesn’t unlock anything.": {
  "page": "index.html"
 },
