 "Privacy Policy · MimoDays": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Privacy Policy": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Last updated: November 16, 2026. The short version: MimoDays doesn’t collect, keep or share your personal data. There is no account and no MimoDays server.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Who makes MimoDays": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "MimoDays is made by Andrew Maier, an independent developer. Questions about this policy: <a href=\"mailto:mimodays@mrmaier.com\">mimodays@mrmaier.com</a>.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "What stays on your device": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Your photos, videos, voice notes and their transcripts, notes, places, collections and movie projects are kept in the app’s storage on your iPhone or iPad. MimoDays never sends them to me or to anyone else.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "If iCloud Backup is on for your device, Apple may include this data in your device backup, under Apple’s privacy policy.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Permissions": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "<strong>Camera and microphone:</strong> only while you capture a moment or record a voice note.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "<strong>Location:</strong> optional, and only while you use the app. When you save a moment with a place, its name is looked up through Apple’s map service. You choose how precise places are, and you can turn them off.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "<strong>Photos:</strong> MimoDays can only add to your library, to save what you export. Photos you import are chosen in Apple’s picker, and MimoDays sees only the ones you pick.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "<strong>Notifications:</strong> surprises are scheduled on your device; no server sends them.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "<strong>Face ID:</strong> App Lock asks iOS to check it; MimoDays never sees your face data.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "<strong>Speech:</strong> on iOS 26 and later, voice notes are transcribed on your device.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Backups and exports": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "A backup is a file you create and save where you choose, for example in Files or iCloud Drive. Whatever you export or share goes only where you send it, and is then handled by that service.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Tips": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Optional tips are in-app purchases handled entirely by Apple. I receive no payment or contact details.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "No tracking": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "MimoDays has no ads, no analytics and no third-party trackers. If you choose to share crash reports with app developers in iOS Settings, Apple may pass anonymous crash data to me.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "This website": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "This site is static: no cookies, no analytics, no forms. Its hosting provider may process technical data such as your IP address to deliver the pages and protect the site.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Your choices": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "You can delete any moment, or everything at once in Settings › Privacy &amp; App Lock › Delete all data. Deleting the app removes all its data from the device.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Children": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "MimoDays collects no personal data from anyone, children included. The app isn’t directed at children under 13.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Your rights": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Because I hold no personal data about you, there is nothing for me to access, correct, export or delete. Everything is on your device and under your control. If you write to me, I use your email only to reply and delete it when the conversation is over.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "Changes": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
 "If this policy changes, the new version will be posted here with a new date.": {
  "page": "privacy-policy/index.html"
 },
